{id:'orin',name:'Orin Dawnshield',role:'Sentinel',path:'Security+',line:'Knowledge is a light worth protecting.',bio:'A veteran guardian who traded conquest for teaching. His rune-etched sword has guarded more libraries than castles.',gear:'Runeblade · gilded armor · protective sigils',color:'#be9ae1'}
